        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execute</strong> is a short active incremental game about reducing the world’s population from 8 billion to zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture people</strong> – gather victims for your machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/12e8e537bdf68c0d2ffcf7f24c813dfa.poster.avif?t=1782402837\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/12e8e537bdf68c0d2ffcf7f24c813dfa.webm?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/12e8e537bdf68c0d2ffcf7f24c813dfa.mp4?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execute</strong> – start with a guillotine, then unlock new methods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/acda73d402f94775cd566378a5a46d61.poster.avif?t=1782402837\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/acda73d402f94775cd566378a5a46d61.webm?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/acda73d402f94775cd566378a5a46d61.mp4?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your arsenal</strong> – mines, contraptions, and machines that scale with your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/c11612f6d31f1907e2b02c0c0c982978.poster.avif?t=1782402837\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/c11612f6d31f1907e2b02c0c0c982978.webm?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/c11612f6d31f1907e2b02c0c0c982978.mp4?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimize Nuclear Supply Chains </strong>– build nukes, lay waste, and accelerate humanity’s demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/29570d2d37d5c012a4dfd7f83675f351.poster.avif?t=1782402837\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/29570d2d37d5c012a4dfd7f83675f351.webm?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/29570d2d37d5c012a4dfd7f83675f351.mp4?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execute</strong> is a short active incremental game about reducing the world’s population from 8 billion to zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture people</strong> – gather victims for your machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/12e8e537bdf68c0d2ffcf7f24c813dfa.poster.avif?t=1782402837\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/12e8e537bdf68c0d2ffcf7f24c813dfa.webm?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/12e8e537bdf68c0d2ffcf7f24c813dfa.mp4?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execute</strong> – start with a guillotine, then unlock new methods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/acda73d402f94775cd566378a5a46d61.poster.avif?t=1782402837\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/acda73d402f94775cd566378a5a46d61.webm?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/acda73d402f94775cd566378a5a46d61.mp4?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your arsenal</strong> – mines, contraptions, and machines that scale with your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/c11612f6d31f1907e2b02c0c0c982978.poster.avif?t=1782402837\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/c11612f6d31f1907e2b02c0c0c982978.webm?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/c11612f6d31f1907e2b02c0c0c982978.mp4?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimize Nuclear Supply Chains </strong>– build nukes, lay waste, and accelerate humanity’s demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/29570d2d37d5c012a4dfd7f83675f351.poster.avif?t=1782402837\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/29570d2d37d5c012a4dfd7f83675f351.webm?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/29570d2d37d5c012a4dfd7f83675f351.mp4?t=1782402837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
